[length:05:24]
[ti:a Flame in the guts]
[ar:Aracnephobia]
[al:Chaotic-Dysfunctional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:01.71]I was going to leave…
[00:07.73]but something started glowing.
[00:42.42]April 3rd
[00:43.77]with the windows shut
[00:45.32]I folded all my futures
[00:46.80]into folders full of dust
[00:48.84]I left the keys
[00:49.97]where the living could find
[00:52.11]every little world
[00:53.54]I was leaving behind
[00:55.60]I wasn’t dramatic
[00:57.14]I was quiet and planned
[00:58.94]with a song in my throat
[01:00.54]and a knife in my hand
[01:02.80]Not for the glory
[01:04.62]not for the night
[01:06.22]I just couldn’t see
[01:07.89]the shape of next light
[01:10.95]Ah-ah-ah…
[01:12.73]under my ribs
[01:14.46]Ya-ah-ah…
[01:16.19]something still lived
[01:17.91]A little ugly miracle
[01:19.60]biting through wire
[01:21.46]A little burning thing
[01:23.16]refusing to die
[01:25.30]One more sound, one more day
[01:28.81]one more flame that won’t go away
[01:32.48]One more sound, one more day
[01:35.37]I feed it with sounds
[01:37.47]when I don’t want to wake
[01:39.71]There’s a flame in my guts
[01:41.03]and it glows through the fire
[01:43.15]it doesn’t make me holy
[01:44.59]it just keeps me alive
[01:46.71]No one saved me
[01:48.35]nothing came clean
[01:50.15]but I made one more sound
[01:51.74]from the rot inside me
[01:53.97]One more sound, one more day
[01:57.35]one more flame that won’t go away
[02:00.93]No white room fixed me
[02:02.86]no clean little pill
[02:04.60]no voice on the line
[02:06.42]could climb through the sill
[02:08.06]No blessed hand reached me
[02:09.50]no expert broke through
[02:11.37]they named all the weather
[02:13.40]but the storm already knew
[02:15.47]I don’t blame the living
[02:16.84]for not being a rope
[02:18.67]some rooms are too sunken
[02:20.32]for ordinary hope
[02:22.22]So I built from the static
[02:24.09]with my mouth full of rust
[02:25.64]not because I believed
[02:27.59]but because I still must
[02:29.83]Don’t call it rescue
[02:31.55]don’t call it grace
[02:33.28]don’t make it pretty
[02:34.89]don’t soften the place
[02:36.78]I was not saved
[02:38.55]I was not found
[02:40.21]I just heard something breathing
[02:42.02]under the sound
[02:44.09]One more sound, one more day
[02:47.56]one more flame that won’t go away
[02:51.28]One more sound, one more day
[02:54.17]I feed it with sounds
[02:56.21]when I don’t want to wake
[02:58.17]There’s a flame in my guts
[02:59.77]and it glows through the fire
[03:01.80]it doesn’t make me holy
[03:03.35]it just keeps me alive
[03:05.59]No one saved me
[03:07.20]nothing came clean
[03:08.85]but I made one more sound
[03:10.49]from the rot inside me
[03:12.66]Glow, glow, little wrong thing
[03:14.59]glow, glow, under my skin
[03:16.43]Glow, glow, little strange thing
[03:18.21]don’t let the dark win
[03:19.92]One more sound
[03:21.48]one more day
[03:23.38]One more sound
[03:25.08]one more day
[03:27.16]There was a girl
[03:28.00]with paint on her hands
[03:28.94]There was a spark
[03:29.86]that nobody planned
[03:30.70]She lived in the corner
[03:31.52]she lived in the seams
[03:32.44]she drew little doors
[03:33.25]on the backs of bad dreams
[03:34.00]I thought I had killed her
[03:34.84]by learning to smile
[03:37.58]but she waited inside me
[03:40.43]quiet and wild
[03:48.62]Ah-ah-ah…
[03:50.61]inside the wire
[03:52.17]Ah-ah-ah…
[03:54.34]inside the wound
[03:55.89]Ya-ah-ah…
[03:57.74]inside the child
[03:59.41]Ya-ah-ah…
[04:01.28]inside the room
[04:03.04]NO SAVIOR
[04:04.11]NO CURE
[04:04.97]NO SIGN
[04:05.89]NO DOOR
[04:06.64]STILL ALIVE
[04:07.56]STILL SORE
[04:08.32]MAKE SOUND
[04:09.36]ONE MORE
[04:10.12]I don’t need heaven
[04:10.93]I don’t need proof
[04:11.83]I need the next note
[04:12.87]to tear through the roof
[04:13.61]I don’t need saving
[04:14.51]I don’t need light
[04:15.43]I need this flame
[04:17.92]to bite back tonight
[04:22.66]One more sound, one more day
[04:26.16]one more flame that won’t go away
[04:29.86]One more sound, one more day
[04:32.71]I feed it with sounds
[04:35.43]when I don’t want to wake
[04:36.68]There’s a flame in my guts
[04:38.17]and it glows through the fire
[04:40.18]it doesn’t make me holy
[04:41.64]it just keeps me alive
[04:43.98]No one saved me
[04:45.64]nothing came clean
[04:47.39]but I made one more sound
[04:48.92]from the rot inside me
[04:51.25]One more sound, one more day
[04:54.51]still not saved
[04:57.03]still here anyway
[05:02.13]Not saved.
[05:03.11]Not cured.
[05:07.50]Still here.
[05:08.74]Still glowing.
